  <Name>Automata</Name>
  <Description>Automatons to make your life easier.

This mod encourages logistics-driven gameplay by enabling drones to perform tasks that are commonly performed by players.

[h2]Features[/h2]

[list]
[*]Automated drones!
[*]Logistics oriented gameplay: no more massive bases, create small hubs with purpose, your drones will handle deliveries for you.
[*]Weld anything: projected, hand-placed, or repairs, your welder drones will fix it.
[*]Grind: paint anything with the grind color and watch it go away.
[*]Mine: send your drones to scout for ores, and mine them!
[*]Fight: control your your combat drones to engage an enemy, or escort a friendly.
[/list]

Full guide here https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3817492846</Description>
